Package: CARVE
Title: Cluster Analysis with Resampling for Validation and Exploration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kai", "Wycik", email = "kai.wycik@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Stability- and generalizability-based validation of clustering
    methods via repeated subsampling, consensus matrices, and rule-based
    selection. Provides a scikit-learn style estimator with integration for
    Seurat and SingleCellExperiment workflows.
